
%9Syntax:%9

TKHELP%|

%9Description:%9

    Prints the short built-in help of the tk.pl script (same as /TK HELP):
    /TKL syntax, options, the other commands, the list of settings and the
    audit log path. Full description: /HELP TK and /HELP TKL.

%9Examples:%9

    /TKHELP

%9See also:%9 KLIST, TK, TKL, TKLIST, UNTKL

